ountaineers Welcome Coastal Carolina for Senior Night</title><link>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/10/28/mens-soccer-mountaineers-welcome-coastal-carolina-for-senior-night</link><guid>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/10/28/mens-soccer-mountaineers-welcome-coastal-carolina-for-senior-night</guid><category>Men's Soccer</category><description><![CDATA[<img alt="Sebastian Burke" src="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&image_path=/images/2026/10/28/MSOC_vDenver_09112026_63_large.jpg" /><br /><br />MORGANTOWN, W.Va. – The No. 13 West Virginia University men's soccer team welcomes Coastal Carolina for its final home game of the regular season, Thursday night. Kickoff from Dick Dlesk Soccer Stadium is set for 7 p.m.]]></description><media:thumbnail url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_system&amp;image_path=/images/2026/10/28/MSOC_vDenver_09112026_63_large.jpg" /><media:content url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/10/28/MSOC_vDenver_09112026_63_large.jpg"><media:title>Sebastian Burke</media:title></media:content><enclosure url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/10/28/MSOC_vDenver_09112026_63_large.jpg" length="1" type="image/jpg" /><pubDate>Wed, 28 Oct 2026 13:01:00 EST</pubDate><s:sport_id>6</s:sport_id><s:story_id>59603</s:story_id></item><item><title>Walton Named to Cheryl Miller Award Watch List</title><link>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/10/28/womens-basketball-walton-named-to-cheryl-miller-award-watch-list</link><guid>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/10/28/womens-basketball-walton-named-to-cheryl-miller-award-watch-list</guid><category>Women's Basketball</category><description><![CDATA[<img alt="Zaza Walton during preseason practice" src="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&image_path=/images/2026/10/28/072326_Practice_TL_04.jpg" /><br /><br />SPRINGFIELD, MASS. — The Naismith Basketball Hall of Fame announced the 20 watch-list candidates for the 2027 Julius Erving Award and, in partnership with the Women's Basketball Coaches Association (WBCA), the 20 watch-list candidates for the 2027 Cheryl Miller Award. The annual Julius Erving Award, named after the Class of 1993 Hall of Famer and 17-year professional basketball player, celebrates its 13th year by recognizing the top small forward in NCAA Division I men's college basketball. The Cheryl Miller Award, in its 10th year, honors the top small forward in NCAA Division I women's college basketball. It is named after the three-time Naismith Player of the Year and Class of 1995 Hall of Famer.]]></description><media:thumbnail url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_system&amp;image_path=/images/2026/10/28/072326_Practice_TL_04.jpg" /><media:content url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/10/28/072326_Practice_TL_04.jpg"><media:title>Zaza Walton during preseason practice</media:title></media:content><enclosure url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/10/28/072326_Practice_TL_04.jpg" length="1" type="image/jpg" /><pubDate>Wed, 28 Oct 2026 13:00:00 EST</pubDate><s:sport_id>9</s:sport_id><s:story_id>59599</s:story_id></item><item><title>Smith Earns Big 12 Starting Seven Honors</title><link>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/10/27/volleyball-smith-earns-big-12-starting-seven-honors</link><guid>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/10/27/volleyball-smith-earns-big-12-starting-seven-honors</guid><category>Volleyball</category><description><![CDATA[<img alt="Macie Smith earned Big 12 Starting Seven honors for her performance against Arizona" src="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&image_path=/images/2026/10/27/VB26_Big12Starting7_1920x1080__1_.jpg" /><br /><br />MORGANTOWN, W.Va. – West Virginia University volleyball freshman outside hitter Macie Smith has been named to the Big 12 Starting Seven of the Week following a record-breaking performance over the weekend.]]></description><media:thumbnail url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_system&amp;image_path=/images/2026/10/27/VB26_Big12Starting7_1920x1080__1_.jpg" /><media:content url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/10/27/VB26_Big12Starting7_1920x1080__1_.jpg"><media:title>Macie Smith earned Big 12 Starting Seven honors for her performance against Arizona</media:title></media:content><enclosure url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/10/27/VB26_Big12Starting7_1920x1080__1_.jpg" length="1" type="image/jpg" /><pubDate>Tue, 27 Oct 2026 15:00:00 EST</pubDate><s:sport_id>17</s:sport_id><s:story_id>59595</s:story_id></item><item><title>Mountaineers to Wrap Up Exhibition Play on Wednesday at Hope Coliseum</title><link>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/10/27/mens-basketball-mountaineers-to-wrap-up-exhibition-play-on-wednesday-at-hope-coliseum</link><guid>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/10/27/mens-basketball-mountaineers-to-wrap-up-exhibition-play-on-wednesday-at-hope-coliseum</guid><category>Men's Basketball</category><description><![CDATA[<img alt="Wheeling Advance" src="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&image_path=/images/2026/10/26/MBB26_Matchup_1920x1080_wheeling2.jpg" /><br /><br />MORGANTOWN, W.Va. – West Virginia concludes its preseason with a Wednesday night exhibition game against Wheeling University at Hope Coliseum.]]></description><media:thumbnail url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_system&amp;image_path=/images/2026/10/26/MBB26_Mat