ler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/10/27/MBB26_WestAwardWatchlist_1920x1080.jpg" length="1" type="image/jpg" /><pubDate>Tue, 27 Oct 2026 12:44:00 EST</pubDate><s:sport_id>4</s:sport_id><s:story_id>59597</s:story_id></item><item><title>Mawer Earns Sun Belt, National Honors</title><link>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/10/27/mens-soccer-mawer-earns-sun-belt-national-honors</link><guid>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/10/27/mens-soccer-mawer-earns-sun-belt-national-honors</guid><category>Men's Soccer</category><description><![CDATA[<img alt="Toby Mawer in goal for the West Virginia men's soccer team" src="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&image_path=/images/2026/10/27/MSOC_WVUvsUCF_Oct21_2026_TT_60_large.jpg" /><br /><br />MORGANTOWN, W.Va. – Redshirt sophomore Toby Mawer of the West Virginia University men's soccer team has been named the Sun Belt Defensive Player of the Week as well as the Top Drawer Soccer National Player of the Week.]]></description><media:thumbnail url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_system&amp;image_path=/images/2026/10/27/MSOC_WVUvsUCF_Oct21_2026_TT_60_large.jpg" /><media:content url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/10/27/MSOC_WVUvsUCF_Oct21_2026_TT_60_large.jpg"><media:title>Toby Mawer in goal for the West Virginia men's soccer team</media:title></media:content><enclosure url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/10/27/MSOC_WVUvsUCF_Oct21_2026_TT_60_large.jpg" length="1" type="image/jpg" /><pubDate>Tue, 27 Oct 2026 12:31:00 EST</pubDate><s:sport_id>6</s:sport_id><s:story_id>59596</s:story_id></item><item><title>WVU’s Parrish Taking the Long View on her College Career</title><link>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/10/27/womens-basketball-wvus-parrish-taking-the-long-view-on-her-college-career</link><guid>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/10/27/womens-basketball-wvus-parrish-taking-the-long-view-on-her-college-career</guid><category>Women's Basketball</category><description><![CDATA[<img alt="Sophomore guard Madison Parrish participates in a drill inside the Basketball Practice Facility during the fall of 2026." src="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&image_path=/images/2026/10/27/Parrish-Main.jpg" /><br /><br />MORGANTOWN, W.Va. – While taking in some of the amusing social media postings made by a certain college sports megadonor last weekend, my mind drifted back to a conversation we had last Thursday evening with West Virginia sophomore women's basketball player Madison Parrish.]]></description><media:thumbnail url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_system&amp;image_path=/images/2026/10/27/Parrish-Main.jpg" /><media:content url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/10/27/Parrish-Main.jpg"><media:title>Sophomore guard Madison Parrish participates in a drill inside the Basketball Practice Facility during the fall of 2026.</media:title></media:content><enclosure url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/10/27/Parrish-Main.jpg" length="1" type="image/jpg" /><pubDate>Tue, 27 Oct 2026 11:27:00 EST</pubDate><s:sport_id>9</s:sport_id><s:story_id>59594</s:story_id></item><item><title>Mawer, Salcedo Named Co-Student-Athletes of the Week</title><link>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/10/26/mens-soccer-mawer-salcedo-named-student-athlete-of-the-week</link><guid>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/10/26/mens-soccer-mawer-salcedo-named-student-athlete-of-the-week</guid><category>Men's Soccer, Men's Swimming &amp; Diving</category><description><![CDATA[<img alt="Toby Mawer and Jake Salcedo were named Student-Athletes of the Week" src="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&image_path=/images/2026/10/26/mawer-salcedo.png" /><br /><br />MORGANTOWN, W.Va. – Redshirt sophomore Toby Mawer of the West Virginia University men's soccer team and sophomore Jake Salcedo of the men's swimming and diving team have been named the WVU Co-Student-Athletes of the Week, presented by University Apartments.]]></description><media:thumbnail url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_system&amp;image_path=/images/2026/10/26/mawer-salcedo.png" /><media:content url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/10/26/mawer-salcedo.png"><media:title>Toby Mawer and Jake Salcedo were named Student-Athletes of the Week</media:title></media:content><enclosure url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/10/26/mawer-salcedo.png" length="1" type="image/jpg" /><pubDate>Mon, 26 Oct 2026 14:49:00 EST</pubDate><s:sport_id>6</s:sport_id><s:story_id>59593</s:story_id></item><item><title>Six-Day Window to be Exercised for Nov. 7 Game at Texas Tech</title><link>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/10/26/football-six-day-window-to-be-exercised-for-nov-7-game-at-texas-tech</link><guid>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/10/26/football-six-day-window-to-be-exercised-for-nov-7-game-at-texas-tech</guid><category>Football</category><description><![CDATA[<img alt="cam-cook-TCU" src="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&image_path=/images/2026/10/26/FB_WVUvsTCU_Oct24_2026_JS-16.jpg" /><br /><br />MORGANTOWN, W.Va. – The Big 12 Conference has announced that ESPN and FOX will utilize a six-day window to announce the broadcast network and time slot for WVU's Saturday, Nov. 7 Big 12 Conference football game at Texas Tech at Galaxy Stadium in Lubbock, Texas.]]></description><media:thumbnail url="https://wvusports.com/co